      "message": "feat(core): add getCursorPosition + getScrollInfo APIs and plugin-autosave\n\nB — EditorAPI query methods:\n- getCursorPosition(): returns 1-based line, 1-based column, 0-based offset\n- getScrollInfo(): returns scrollTop/scrollLeft/scrollHeight/clientHeight\n- _nexusView (@internal): bridge for plugins needing CM6 EditorView access\n\nC — plugin-autosave:\n- createAutosavePlugin({ onSave, debounceMs }): debounced auto-save\n- isDirty(editor): document-snapshot-based dirty check (not boolean flag)\n- forceSave(editor): immediate flush for SPA route navigation\n- State lives in WeakMap<EditorView, AutosaveState> — no cross-instance\n  stomping, no stateful plugin object anti-pattern\n- Snapshots captured synchronously before await to prevent race conditions",
      "date": "2026-06-02T12:09:49Z"
    }
